  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rnd3](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rnd3) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 14 2025 26km N of Esia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.3477 longitude -175.6934. It impacted 212 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
